  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;MARTIN-PIERRE TREMBLAY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Martin-Pierre Tremblay is a renowned Canadian journalist and writer known for his work in promoting Odia culture and language globally."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SARALA PURASKAR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"AWARD"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sarala Puraskar is a prestigious literary award given annually to outstanding Odia writers, instituted in 1979."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PRIX LITTÉRAIRE DESJARDINS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"AWARD"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Prix littéraire Desjardins is a prestigious literary award in Quebec, established in 2001, recognizing outstanding literary achievements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Prix littéraire Desjardins is a prestigious literary award that recognizes outstanding works of literature."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BHUBANESWAR CONVENTION CENTRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bhubaneswar Convention Centre is the venue for the Sarala Puraskar award ceremony in Odisha, India."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ODIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LANGUAGE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Odia is the language and culture Tremblay has promoted through his work, recognized by the Sarala Puraskar award."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE IN-BETWEEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BOOK"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The In-Between is a critically acclaimed book by Tremblay, exploring the immigrant experience and well-received in Odisha."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. NANDINI SATPATHY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Nandini Satpathy is a renowned Odia scholar and jury member for the Sarala Puraskar award."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;QUEBEC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Quebec is the region where Tremblay's work has resonated and where the Prix littéraire Desjardins is based."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MONTREAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Montreal is the city where Tremblay is based and where the Prix littéraire Desjardins announcement was made."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PRIX LITTÉRAIRE DESJARDINS COMMITTEE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Prix littéraire Desjardins committee is the organization that selects winners for the prestigious literary award."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;QUEBEC WRITERS' FEDERATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Quebec Writers' Federation provides data on Tremblay's work and its reception in Quebec."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CANADIAN JOURNALIST&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Canadian Journalist is a role held by Martin-Pierre Tremblay, emphasizing his professional background."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CANADIAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Canadian refers to Martin-Pierre Tremblay's nationality and the country he works in."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INDIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"India is the country where the Sarala Puraskar award is presented and where Tremblay received the award."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ODISHA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Odisha is the state in India where the Sarala Puraskar award ceremony took place."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ODIA LITERATURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Odia literature is the field of literature Tremblay has contributed to, recognized by the Sarala Puraskar award."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;IMMIGRANT EXPERIENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Immigrant experience is a theme explored in Tremblay's book 'The In-Between', which has been well-received in Odisha."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CROSS-CULTURAL UNDERSTANDING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cross-cultural understanding is a goal Tremblay aims to achieve through his work and the proposed literary exchange program."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LITERARY EXCHANGE PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Literary exchange program is a plan by Tremblay to promote cross-cultural understanding between Canada and Odisha."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROMOTING ODIA CULTURE AND LANGUAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Promoting Odia culture and language is Tremblay's primary contribution, recognized by the Sarala Puraskar award."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CRITICAL ACCLAIM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Critical acclaim is the reception of Tremblay's work, as evidenced by the Sarala Puraskar and Prix littéraire Desjardins awards."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMMERCIAL SUCCESS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Commercial success is the reception of Tremblay's book 'Les chemins de la mémoire', as evidenced by its sales and critical reception."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FEARLESS AND INSIGHTFUL JOURNALIST&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DESCRIPTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fearless and insightful journalist describes Tremblay's approach to journalism, as highlighted by the Prix littéraire Desjardins jury."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ESTEEMED PRIX LITTÉRAIRE DESJARDINS WINNERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Esteemed Prix littéraire Desjardins winners are individuals who have previously won the award, implying recognition and success."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0275</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CANADA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
